# Test coverage gate

Workspace **line** coverage must stay **≥ 80%**. Enforce with `cargo-llvm-cov`
(`llvm-tools-preview` + `cargo install cargo-llvm-cov`). Binary entrypoints
(`**/main.rs`) are ignored — do **not** exclude whole crates to paper over gaps.

```bash
task coverage
# same as:
cargo llvm-cov --workspace --locked --fail-under-lines 80 --summary-only \
  --ignore-filename-regex '(^|/)main\.rs$'
```

After Rust or test changes, do not claim done until `task coverage` passes.
If coverage drops below 80%, add tests for the new/changed paths — do not
lower the threshold, skip the gate, or exclude crates to paper over gaps.

```bash
# BAD — merge without the gate / weaken the floor / exclude crates
cargo test
cargo llvm-cov --fail-under-lines 50
cargo llvm-cov --ignore-filename-regex 'ollama-router-verda'

# GOOD
task check && task coverage
```
